      <span class="has-text-grey-dark mathjax">Accepted to the Thirty-Ninth Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS 2025), 25 pages, 13 figures</span>
    </p>
    

    

    
  </li>

  <li class="arxiv-result">
